OL,3,CGovernment 'has long way to go' to win
OL,4,Cback farmers' trust, Burnham says
OL,6,FWith farmers 'struggling to keep
OL,7,Fgoing' during this summer's drought,
OL,8,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham attempted
OL,9,Fto build bridges following a fallout
OL,10,Fwith the previous government, ITV
OL,11,FNews' Tom Sheldrick reports
OL,13,FAndy Burnham has said the government
OL,14,Fhas a "long way to go to build back
OL,15,Ftrust" with farmers following a row
OL,16,Fover inheritance tax changes proposed
OL,17,Funder Keir Starmer's leadership.
OL,26,@vD@GOUwD@FO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/12
