OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786877294
OL,3,CGovernment 'has long way to go' to win
OL,4,Cback farmers' trust, Burnham says
OL,6,FDuring a visit to a farm near Turo in
OL,7,FCornwall on Saturday as part of a
OL,8,Fnational tour to discuss the cost of
OL,9,Fliving, the prime minister added that
OL,10,Fthe UK needs to "guarantee our own
OL,11,Ffood production going forward".
OL,13,FThe PM unveiled a #65 million funding
OL,14,Fpackage for farmers, amid fears hot,
OL,15,Fdry weather could drive up food prices
OL,16,Fon supermarket shelves.
OL,26,@rD@QOUsD@^O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
