OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786877294
OL,3,CGovernment 'has long way to go' to win
OL,4,Cback farmers' trust, Burnham says
OL,6,FFood producers have been facing a
OL,7,Fmultitude of challenges in recent
OL,8,Fweeks as large areas of the country
OL,9,Fexperience a series of heatwaves,
OL,10,Flittle rainfall and drought.
OL,12,FMany have been forced to harvest crops
OL,13,Fearly, while others are seeing lower
OL,14,Fyields and lower quality produce,
OL,15,Ffollowing the driest July on record.
OL,17,FStarmer's government faced months of
OL,18,Fsustained mass protests by farmers,
OL,19,Fincluding tractors being driven down
OL,20,FWhitehall in opposition to new
OL,21,Finheritance tax laws.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786877294
OL,3,CGovernment 'has long way to go' to win
OL,4,Cback farmers' trust, Burnham says
OL,6,FHis government had planned to impose
OL,7,Finheritance tax on farmers' business
OL,8,Fassets after the first #1 million, but
OL,9,Fraised the tax-free threshold to #2.5
OL,10,Fmillion in a U-turn just before
OL,11,FChristmas.
OL,13,FBurnham visited a family-run potato
OL,14,Ffarm near Truro, Cornwall, on Saturday
OL,15,Fthat has been affected by the drought
OL,16,Fand met National Farmers' Union (NFU)
OL,17,Fpresident Tom Bradshaw.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786877294
OL,3,CGovernment 'has long way to go' to win
OL,4,Cback farmers' trust, Burnham says
OL,6,FSpeaking to broadcasters at Colwyn
OL,7,Ffarm, Burnham said: "I realise we've
OL,8,Fgot a long way to go to build back
OL,9,Ftrust with the farming community
OL,10,Facross the country.
OL,12,F"I think it's probably been the
OL,13,Fhardest summer for British farming in
OL,14,Fa generation."
OL,16,FHe added: "I see food and farming as
OL,17,Fpart of national resilience, national
OL,18,Finfrastructure. We need to be able to
OL,19,Fguarantee our own food production
OL,20,Fgoing forward."
OL,26,@oD@UOUtD@AOUvD@NO]xD@KOU|D@OO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/12
