OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786877294
OL,3,CGovernment 'has long way to go' to win
OL,4,Cback farmers' trust, Burnham says
OL,6,FBurnham said the #65 million funding
OL,7,Fpackage was "new money coming from
OL,8,FDefra budgets".
OL,10,FSpeaking at a meeting with the family
OL,11,Fwho runs FG Pryor & Son Ltd farm,
OL,12,FBurnham said the measures announced
OL,13,Fwere "hopefully a sign of intent and
OL,14,Fan indication to the industry that we
OL,15,Fwant a new conversation".
OL,17,FThe prime minister told the farming
OL,18,Ffamily "let's be honest, we know we've
OL,19,Fgot to win back some trust", and said
OL,20,Fhe was "praying for rain with you".
OL,26,@oD@MOUpD@NO]uD@FOUwD@XO]zD@HOU{D@[O]|D@
OL,26,AHOU|D@bO]
