OL,3,CGovernment 'has long way to go' to win
OL,4,Cback farmers' trust, Burnham says
OL,6,FOf the #65 million, the Sustainable
OL,7,FFarming Incentive (SFI) ` which sees
OL,8,Ffarmers receive payments to support
OL,9,Fnature ` will receive an extra #50
OL,10,Fmillion for this year's pot.
OL,12,FFarmers will also get #15 million in
OL,13,Fsupport for building on-farm
OL,14,Freservoirs to provide supplies during
OL,15,Ffuture dry summers.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30608
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786877294
OL,3,CGovernment 'has long way to go' to win
OL,4,Cback farmers' trust, Burnham says
OL,6,FThe package will aim to support
OL,7,Ffarmers who need to get water to
OL,8,Fcrops, keep livestock fed where grass
OL,9,Fhas failed and are struggling to
OL,10,Fcontinue environmental work without
OL,11,Flosing money.
OL,13,FAs part of the package, farmers will
OL,14,Fsee more flexibility in environmental
OL,15,Fschemes, such as the SFI.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30609
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786877294
OL,3,CGovernment 'has long way to go' to win
OL,4,Cback farmers' trust, Burnham says
OL,6,FThis means those who are paid to look
OL,7,Fafter wildlife habitat on parts of
OL,8,Ftheir land, and are normally barred
OL,9,Ffrom grazing or cutting it until later
OL,10,Fin the year, will now be allowed to do
OL,11,Fso where grass is scarce without
OL,12,Flosing payments.
OL,14,FBurnham said: "With the parched nature
OL,15,Fof the fields, it's really important
OL,16,Fthat they can use all of the available
OL,17,Fland to graze cattle and livestock and
OL,18,Fsheep."
OL,26,@vD@OOUzD@GO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/12
