PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786877294
OL,3,CGovernment 'has long way to go' to win
OL,4,Cback farmers' trust, Burnham says
OL,6,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,7,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,8,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,9,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,11,FNFU president Bradshaw said the
OL,12,Fmeasures were a "really welcome
OL,13,Fstart", however, added that "it
OL,14,Fdoesn't affect the crisis today".
OL,16,F"Many farms are absolutely on edge
OL,17,Fbecause of a disastrous harvest", he
OL,18,Fsaid.
OL,26,@tD@QOUuD@FO]uD@]OUvD@`O]xD@AOUyD@`O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/12
