PN,30611
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786877294
OL,3,CGovernment 'has long way to go' to win
OL,4,Cback farmers' trust, Burnham says
OL,6,F"Fields that should be green are now
OL,7,Fbrown. They're feeding their winter
OL,8,Frations out in the field now, and
OL,9,Fthey're also exposed to disease,"
OL,10,FBradshaw added.
OL,12,F"The money going into the
OL,13,Fenvironmental schemes will help with
OL,14,Fbuilding that environmental resilience
OL,15,Ffor the longer term.
OL,26,@nD@AOUqD@aO]tD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30612
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786877294
OL,3,CGovernment 'has long way to go' to win
OL,4,Cback farmers' trust, Burnham says
OL,6,F"It doesn't help today, and today is
OL,7,Fwhere many of our members are facing
OL,8,Finto probably the most extreme
OL,9,Fchallenge that many have ever faced
OL,10,Fwithin their farms. The worst drought
OL,11,Fin 50 years.
OL,13,F"We have to work together with the
OL,14,Fgovernment to try to make sure that
OL,15,Fall of those farms are still in
OL,16,Fbusiness in 12 months' time, so that
OL,17,Fthen we can plan strategically for the
OL,18,Ffuture."
OL,26,@nD@AOUuD@AOUzD@HO]
